version: 1.0.0
description: Rust entry point and native plugin registration
components:
  tauri-core:
    description: Tauri entry point. Registers opener/dialog/notification plugins; enables the asset protocol; desktop-only menu-bar tray with hide-on-close scoped to the main window. Exposes the open_video command (dedicated looping YouTube window via an injected initialization script). No wake/pmset code — that feature was removed.
    type: core
    file: src-tauri/src/lib.rs
